{"id":"398094270","kind":"article","title":"高质量的间隔重复记忆卡片最重要的属性是什么？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z42J1vxsMjhkdbrqVfoqjiEesSzfaEqurBtoJ","https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z9xavmmNq7xvNqzpnJ3HFXx"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-08-10","updated":"2023-10-25","votes":36,"comment_count":6,"minutes":3,"chars":1262,"keywords":["间隔重复","记忆卡片","检索练习","卡片设计","元认知"],"summary":"本文汇集如何编写高质量间隔重复卡片的原则，包括保持简洁、聚焦原子单元、从多个角度编码概念、建立联系、明确预期答案并要求主动提取；还提醒避免浅层模式匹配及过度依赖填空卡。它是一份持续整理的笔记目录，链接到各项原则的展开文章。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/398094270","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"QtyQe5uy\">本笔记收集了关于如何将知识编码到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>卡片中的想法，既支持对事实的记忆，也促进更丰富的理解（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6UZP7P4sRNgRKSvNj7tMV5uW6dDhwwbdZCy9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统可用于加深概念理解</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"6LT7Z3Q-\">关于这一主题的已发表手稿，见《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://andymatuschak.org/prompts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">如何写出好卡片</a>》<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>(2020)。</p><p data-pid=\"mHmTvqsF\">正在编写的文本：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"ex50uWMs\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zysh2vANAg4bFAqaR5KmwzSR3oe7ybDj465e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆卡片应该简洁</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"Gyavwbt9\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8kPjeqPqJwLwqdVqPYBBTwfU3aczsFyvXFmx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆卡片通常应聚焦于一个原子化单元</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"cfWLnmhs\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3K5a9tM1wq1x4QnDfsUpTeYZWW3M9iUzMdfo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆卡片应该从多个角度对概念进行编码</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><ul><li data-pid=\"haK972xF\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z49EwwPL1CzKHTyLHXwJJH7hsciCg772Vm5WJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆卡片应连接和联系概念</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup><br/><br/></li></ul><li data-pid=\"V_u3Ss78\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7wgJPD7gEoPwiBxuPNS8osvxczccM8Cq2j7F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆卡片应该明确地产生一个具体的答案</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><ul><li data-pid=\"Qq0ooBOq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zpunuHuSjwJtCMogLev1JxXg9V6pSjznwJM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">卡片必须明确说明他们所期望的答案的「形状」</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup><br/><br/></li></ul><li data-pid=\"6pLl8Fj_\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7XLLk9aqBtJLDtP9kemBA87bDtjhpxst1osT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆卡片应确保复习者必须从记忆中提取出答案</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-10\"><a href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><ul><li data-pid=\"aPid9qRO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6MSMik8PUA2XrBQd1mtHrggFX5TBomVNcoRe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">避免使用「对-错」间隔重复记忆卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-11\"><a href=\"#ref-11\">[11]</a></sup><br/><br/></li></ul><li data-pid=\"zovh6McO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6S3cEUXNktEEZEzRqUXh5ivRNMWjJ2nq72Ys\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">编写间隔重复记忆卡片应避免浅层次的「模式匹配」</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-12\"><a href=\"#ref-12\">[12]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"5R6wjgS1\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/Beware_set//enumeration_SRS_prompts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">当心集合/枚举卡片</a><br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"av4qRbNV\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zX7yi8v7qy3n1RfQDkFZFeyTCZPX3BVqy8sC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在间隔重复记忆系统中，填空卡似乎比问答卡产生更少的理解</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-13\"><a href=\"#ref-13\">[13]</a></sup><br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"HaHY-xd7\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zEfpMY7F12gQ6NcbycHCNdpXqxb2mxdkJiX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在 Issa Rice 之后，专家回答启发式</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-14\"><a href=\"#ref-14\">[14]</a></sup></li></ul><p data-pid=\"59WvMnLF\">「重叠」材料：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"aah1s7Ea\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8QtbrR4cxDshTYBq3RCfwUVkXS8mSjRmAnqk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">避免孤立的间隔重复记忆卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-15\"><a href=\"#ref-15\">[15]</a></sup></li></ul><p data-pid=\"-1yCy5uf\">元/心智模型：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"qoG5kV0D\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/Rule_of_thumb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">写更多间隔重复卡片，而不是觉得自然的数量</a><br/><br/></li><li data-pid=\"09D-uZtF\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4TCpuykanZCZYtC5xCccfuiTMZQzdeRv5BuW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">设计间隔重复卡片是为未来的自己设计任务</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-16\"><a href=\"#ref-16\">[16]</a></sup></li></ul><p data-pid=\"tz9J1xOX\">相关文章：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z89GJgodGCjjRSevaswncx8xDPbNNvNfbPKJw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介目标的「反映文章」比喻</a></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><b>参考文献</b></h2><p data-pid=\"qayieqbg\">Matuschak, A. (2020). 如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复来创造理解<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>. <a class=\"external\" href=\"https://andymatuschak.org/prompts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">andymatuschak.org/promp</span><span class=\"invisible\">ts</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p data-pid=\"_zigMN6N\">见和 Nielsen (2018, 2019) 的「我们如何才能开发出变革性的思想工具？<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-17\"><a href=\"#ref-17\">[17]</a></sup>」中的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://numinous.productions/ttft/#improving-mnemonic-medium\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">改进助记媒介：编写更好的卡片</a>一节。</p><p data-pid=\"AmqGnLsd\">Nielsen, M. (2018). 增强长期记忆.<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-18\"><a href=\"#ref-18\">[18]</a></sup> <a class=\"external\" href=\"http://augmentingcognition.com/ltm.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">http://</span><span class=\"visible\">augmentingcognition.com</span><span class=\"invisible\">/ltm.html</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p data-pid=\"WnFTBj8_\">Nielsen, M. (2019, January). 使用间隔重复系统看穿数学证明.<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-19\"><a href=\"#ref-19\">[19]</a></sup> <a class=\"external\" href=\"http://cognitivemedium.com/srs-mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">http://</span><span class=\"visible\">cognitivemedium.com/srs</span><span class=\"invisible\">-mathematics</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><p data-pid=\"-R7FFr8l\">Wozniak, P. (1999, February). 有效的学习：20 条知识表述规则.<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-20\"><a href=\"#ref-20\">[20]</a></sup> <a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.supermemo.com/en/archives1990-2015/articles/20rules\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"visible\">supermemo.com/en/archiv</span><span class=\"invisible\">es1990-2015/articles/20rules</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"lyGLDuYs\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397245681\" href=\"#/post/397245681\">写好间隔重复记忆卡片很难</a></li><li data-pid=\"n1ysUJ_g\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398045447\" href=\"#/post/398045447\">间隔重复记忆系统可用于加深概念理解</a></li><li data-pid=\"ZuADE7Wm\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"399811533\" href=\"#/post/399811533\">在间隔重复记忆系统中，优化的关键是复习环节及其内容的情感联系</a></li><li data-pid=\"5wfzmipC\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介 (Mnemonic medium)</a></li><li data-pid=\"DfwH0bWL\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"642714761\" href=\"#/post/642714761\">助记媒介如何在平台类知识之外的体裁中赋能读者？</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"HruteWVs\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"YClac7XI\">原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z42J1vxsMjhkdbrqVfoqjiEesSzfaEqurBtoJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What are the most important attributes of good spaced repetition memory prompts?</a></blockquote><hr/><p data-pid=\"kZwjm4VC\">更多有关制卡原则的内容，请关注：</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/collection/614280525\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">制卡原则与知识表述</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统可用于加深概念理解 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398045447\" href=\"#/post/398045447\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解 <a c